Subject: Cantor Nested Inner Launch Plan P0 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 3ac01665-072e-4060-81a4-6313a2fa8648
@ [canonical_uuid] 5a67e2bc-17a6-4207-939e-7a521945dcc6

& [Need]
  + NHC-03 admits only supplied descriptor and authorization correspondence; it cannot safely become process creation or runtime truth
  + the next dependency needs an exact inspectable direct plan cancellation and terminal-fault account before any physical custody code

& [Decision]
  + compile a pure provider-free launch plan with full upstream replay distinct identity fixed bindings detached plan authorization one attempt zero retry ambiguity preservation and zero effects

& [Rejected]
  + shell command strings PATH lookup ambient environment implicit retry immediate process launch model load provider contact inferred cancellation cleanup success or merging NHC-05 custody and NHC-06 attention

& [Consequence]
  + later physical work receives a deterministic falsifiable input while all effect and custody authority remains separately signed
